#: includes/admin/class-sync-admin.php:148
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Good to know: calendar links are not instant. This website checks the other "
"calendars every %d minutes, and Booking.com or Airbnb read this website's "
"link on their own schedule (often every few hours). A guest could book the "
"same dates in between. If you also sell on Booking.com or Airbnb, we "
"recommend \"Booking requests\" (Settings → Features), so you confirm each "
"website booking yourself."
